---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    actor Steward
    participant AdminSite as Admin site page<br/>admin/sites/[id]
    participant Pages as Site page and<br/>profile page
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant DB as Supabase DB

    Note over Admin,DB: Covers US 3.0.2 (MoSCoW: Would Like But Won't Get). "(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Admin->>AdminSite: Open site and select Designate steward (proposed)
    Admin->>AdminSite: Type part of a name or email
    AdminSite->>Server: searchStewards(text) (proposed)
    Server->>Server: Check caller is Admin<br/>from a trusted role source (proposed)
    alt Caller is not Admin
        Server-->>AdminSite: Refuse. Return no data
    else Caller is Admin
        Server->>DB: Find stewards by name or email
        DB-->>Server: Matching stewards
        Server-->>AdminSite: Steward list
        AdminSite-->>Admin: Show matches (AT 1)
    end

    Admin->>AdminSite: Select one steward and Save
    AdminSite->>Server: designateSiteSteward(siteId, stewardId) (proposed)
    Server->>Server: Check caller is Admin<br/>from a trusted role source (proposed)
    alt Caller is not Admin (AT 4)
        Server-->>AdminSite: Refuse. No designation is written
        AdminSite-->>Admin: Show error
    else Caller is Admin
        Server->>DB: Replace the designation of the site<br/>with the new steward (proposed)
        DB-->>Server: Saved
        Server-->>AdminSite: Success
        AdminSite-->>Admin: Show new designated steward (AT 2)
    end

    Steward->>Pages: Open site page or steward profile
    Pages->>Server: Get site or profile data
    Server->>DB: Read designation by site or by steward (proposed)
    DB-->>Server: Designation
    Server-->>Pages: Data with designation
    Pages-->>Steward: Show designated steward on site page<br/>and designated sites on profile (AT 3)

    Note over AdminSite,DB: The role check must not use user_metadata. A user can change it (see .agents/rules/security.md).
